# Applies when building june-api/Dockerfile with the repository root as the
# context (the only supported invocation). Allowlist: the june-api workspace
# and the shared companion wire-protocol crate, nothing else.
*
!june-api/**
!crates/june-companion-protocol/**
june-api/target
june-api/deploy
june-api/.github
crates/june-companion-protocol/target
**/*.md
!june-api/crates/services/src/prompts/*.md
# Local env files hold real provider keys. CI checkouts have none, but local
# `make ephemeral-api` builds do, and the chef/planner stages copy the whole
# workspace - without this they land in the builder cache. Secrets reach a CVM
# only via Phala sealed env, never via the image.
june-api/.env
june-api/.env.*
